 matching lace belt cinches her waist, accentuating the dress's tiered, A-line silhouette. The skirt flares out around her legs, and the fabric billows around her as if caught in a gentle breeze, suggesting movement and grace.\n\n**The Setting:**\nShe stands in a golden field of tall grass and wildflowers, which stretches out to meet a gentle hill in the background. The foreground is softly blurred, drawing focus to the woman while still hinting at the expanse of the landscape. The field is bathed in warm, golden sunlight, giving everything a soft, ethereal glow.\n\n**The Sky:**\nAbove her, the sky is a brilliant, clear blue, dotted with fluffy, white cumulus clouds. The clouds are well-lit by the sun, creating a beautiful contrast against the blue. The lighting suggests it is either late morning or early afternoon on a bright, sunny day.\n\n**Composition and Mood:**\nThe composition is dynamic yet tranquil. The low-angle perspective makes the woman appear to be reaching for the sky, emphasizing her connection with nature. The diagonal lines of her arms and the wind-blown hair create a sense of motion and energy, while her calm expression and closed eyes provide a feeling of stillness and serenity. The overall mood is one of peace, joy, and liberation — a perfect capture of a moment where the woman feels completely at home in the natural world. The image evokes feelings of nostalgia, dreaminess, and the simple beauty of being alive in the present moment."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 159, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [490.320068359375, 498.8816223144531], "pos": [-2187.982177734375, 1763.5252685546875], "id": 98, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [181, 184], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "col